# The seeded demo database IS committed on purpose: Catalyst deploys straight
# from this GitHub branch with no build/seed step, so the function needs the
# .db file present in the repo or every query fails at runtime. It's fully
# synthetic (scripts/seed.js), 1.1MB, no real personal data.
